# The record scenario: spin with the wireframe on, then the toybox, a flick of the center toy toward its neighbour and the wireframe off.
# Each line is `frame verb args`. A line runs after its frame publishes and lands at the next boundary.

0 spin on
19 wireframe on
59 demo toybox

# Grab the center toy and fling it right.
89 pointer 0 0.03 down
91 pointer 0.05 0.05 move
93 pointer 0.12 0.08 move
95 pointer 0.2 0.1 move
96 pointer 0.2 0.1 up

139 wireframe off
